-    Deterministic for the unchanged prompt — never retried: one configured-fallback try,
-    else surface the refusal (explanation may live only in the reasoning channel)."""
+    myrmidon(G1): the same call is re-issued up to ``_CONTENT_FILTER_RETRIES``
+    times in a row (at most ``_CONTENT_FILTER_RETRIES_PER_TURN`` per turn); then one configured-fallback try, else surface the refusal (explanation may
+    live only in the reasoning channel)."""
